\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/watchos-26-gradient-light-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"watchos-26-gradient-light\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16535,\"date\":\"2026-07-28T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-28T06:00:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"aggiorna-ora-ios-26-6-macos-tahoe-26-6-centinaia-falle-sicurezza\",\"title\":\"Aggiorna ora: iOS 26.6 e macOS Tahoe 26.6 chiudono centinaia di falle di sicurezza\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple rilascia iOS 26.6, iPadOS 26.6 e macOS Tahoe 26.6 con numerose patch di sicurezza: quasi 90 vulnerabilità su iOS/iPadOS e oltre 130 su macOS, più aggiornamenti anche per tvOS, watchOS e visionOS.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/apple-lock-security-bug-vulnerability-fix-privacy-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"apple-lock-security-bug-vulnerability-fix-privacy\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16479,\"date\":\"2026-07-24T11:40:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-24T09:40:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"emergency-sos-via-satellite-arriva-anche-in-andorra-e-islanda\",\"title\":\"Emergency SOS via satellite arriva anche in Andorra e Islanda\",\"excerpt\":\"Emergency SOS via satellite si espande in Andorra e Islanda: disponibile su iPhone 14 e successivi e Apple Watch Ultra 3 con iOS 26.4 e watchOS 26.4 o versioni successive.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/Emergency-SOS-via-Satellite-iPhone-YT-768x430.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Emergency-SOS-via-Satellite-iPhone-YT\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\